\title{qualitranslate: Translation Workflow for Qualitative Interview Transcripts}
\description{
A local browser workspace for translating qualitative interview transcripts:
forward translation, blind back-translation (the request holds only the forward
translation), reconciliation that flags discrepancies by category and severity, and a
mandatory named human review, followed by a six-file export with a truthful methods
record. Start it with \code{\link[=run_app]{run_app()}}; \code{\link[=show_prompts]{show_prompts()}} prints the translation instructions.
